        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "所以葬支要葬在山顶，葬珑要葬在山脚。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book023-b000261-p000-c61d1609a3",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "在山巅处安葬支龙，是要让缓势的龙脉变得急促；在山麓处安葬珑龙，是要让急促的龙脉变得和缓。金牛说：地势和缓的地方不妨碍在山巅安葬，地势急促的时候也不怕在深泥处安葬。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book023-b000263-p000-e02cab2d7c",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "占卜支龙的吉凶如同占卜人的头部，占卜珑龙的吉凶如同占卜人的足部。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
