        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "所谓如首如足，也就是巅麓的意思，是说要追求那种如首如足的状态。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
